    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_details">What the app sends:\n• The IP Info website (ip-info.leunos.com) receives the requests your use of the website causes, as in any browser.\n• GitHub (api.github.com and github.com) receives update checks and downloads: your IP address and the app version in the user agent. No account or token is used.\n\nWhat stays on your device:\n• Network diagnostics (Wi-Fi name, BSSID, local IP addresses, DNS servers, …) are read from Android on demand and are never stored or sent anywhere.\n• Update settings and state are stored locally.\n\nNo analytics, advertising or tracking SDKs are included.</string>
